    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Thrill of Word Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>&quot;<strong><i>Wheel of Words: Crossword</i></strong>&quot; is a delightful <strong>word puzzle game</strong> designed to test your vocabulary and <strong>problem-solving skills</strong>. Connect letters to form words that fit into crossword puzzles, uncover hidden bonus words, and enjoy the rewarding feeling of completing each grid. With a <strong>smooth interface and simple controls</strong>, the game ensures an engaging <strong>experience</strong> for players of all ages. Hints are <strong>available</strong> to guide you through tricky levels, so you're never stuck for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey Through Words</strong> <br>The game features over 70+ levels per language, organized into difficulty tiers ranging from Very Easy to Expert. Whether you want a casual challenge or something that pushes your word mastery to the limit, there\u2019s always a level that matches your mood and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into Special Categories</strong> <br>Expand your horizons with unique themed puzzles, including &quot;<strong>Phrases in Japanese</strong>&quot; and bonus categories like &quot;<strong>Animals</strong>&quot; and &quot;<strong>IT</strong>.&quot; Note that these <strong>bonus categories</strong> are available only in the  English and Polish versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock your inner wordsmith and enjoy endless hours of puzzle-solving with &quot;Wheel of Words: Crossword&quot;!</p>",
